# Project 1: AdventureWorks 2025 Sales Overview

Power BI dashboard analyzing sales performance for AdventureWorks.

## Preview
![Dashboard](images/dashboard.png)
## Key Metrics
- Total Orders: 1,465
- Total Due: 33.93M
- Order Quantity: 86K
- Subtotal: 3M

## Insights
- Orders peaked in 2013 (708 orders)
- Bikes are the top product category (1.19K orders)
- Canada has the highest number of orders (448)

